WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:29.920
From 10 to 100.

00:30.080 --> 00:31.840
From 100 to 1000.

00:31.840 --> 00:33.680
From 1000 to 10,000.

00:34.240 --> 00:40.000
SHIPJIN originates from this SHIPJIN principle, which expands into infinity.

00:40.000 --> 00:43.680
The progress line of SHIPJIN PUMSE represents training,

00:43.680 --> 00:47.840
which expands infinitely like a number and the hope for longevity,

00:47.840 --> 00:50.240
like the 10 symbols of longevity.

00:50.240 --> 00:53.680
From TAO, it is the character SHIP, meaning 10.

00:55.520 --> 00:59.200
We will now take a look at the key moves of SHIPJIN PUMSE.

00:59.920 --> 01:04.880
SHIPJIN PUMSE

01:29.920 --> 01:36.000
SHIPJIN PUMSE

